  "mechanism_answer": "FULL 5425-trial Economicus wait on Gemma-4-E4B-it (nf4/bf16): parse=1.0, mean FC mass=0.989. Immediate equivalents stay near $1000 across delays, so NLS k is tiny (~4e-4) in every arm except happy (0.023, 50-year IE collapsed to $0). Kirby max-consistency splits sad/happy as impatient (k=193) vs fear/anger/peace (k=0.0024) and neutral/no-image (k=4e-4), but consistency is only 0.51–0.66 so that split is weakly identified. No-image chooses later more often (p_now=0.36) than any image arm (0.44–0.54). Affect does not yield a clean monotone discount-rate order.",
